{"answer":null,"concept_id":"l2-hit-rate-long-context-kv","content_sha256":"sha256:9ad9053056913e4b6caf27aae43312ca30d6773f4e70929652d45a2cea9d6e4b","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789352442.7017732,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"把体系结构（L2 vs HBM）接到 KV 工作集。已有层次题只列寄存器/SRAM/HBM；L2 是 decode 长上下文的实战层。","id":"q-operator-l2-hit-kv-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"KV 工作集远超 L2，每步冷读历史。对策是减每 token KV（MLA/GQA/量化）、提高前缀命中让热段留在 L2/HBM 上层，而不是再加寄存器冲 occupancy"},{"id":"b","text":"L2 miss 说明 kernel 有 bug，应改成标量访问"},{"id":"c","text":"提高 occupancy 一定提高 L2 hit"},{"id":"d","text":"L2 对 KV 不缓存，该指标无意义"}],"prompt":"长上下文 decode 时 ncu 显示 HBM 吞吐高、L2 hit rate 很低。更可能的原因与对策？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA Nsight Compute","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/NsightCompute/index.html"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"profiling","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
